{"id":296,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"朝カツと探究で自ら学ぶ姿勢を育てる中学教育","feature_description":"「強く 正しく 大らかに」を校訓とし、自ら学び、自ら考え、自ら道をひらく意欲を大切にしています。中学では朝の10分を使う「朝カツ」や習熟度に応じた数学演習、チームティーチングなどを行い、基礎学力と学習習慣を支援。探究発表や英会話、部活動を含めた学校生活を通して、主体性や協働する姿勢を育てます。学校生活の中で社会性も養います。","clubs":[{"id":4410,"name":"剣道部 （中高合同活動）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buzan.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/pdf/jhs-exam/pamphlet/2027.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4411,"name":"水泳部 （中高合同活動）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buzan.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/pdf/jhs-exam/pamphlet/2027.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4412,"name":"体操部 （中高合同活動）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buzan.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/pdf/jhs-exam/pamphlet/2027.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4413,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buzan.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/pdf/jhs-exam/pamphlet/2027.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4414,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buzan.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/pdf/jhs-exam/pamphlet/2027.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4415,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buzan.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/pdf/jhs-exam/pamphlet/2027.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4416,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buzan.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/pdf/jhs-exam/pamphlet/2027.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4417,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buzan.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/pdf/jhs-exam/pamphlet/2027.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4418,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buzan.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/pdf/jhs-exam/pamphlet/2027.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4419,"name":"ワンダーフォーゲル部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buzan.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/pdf/jhs-exam/pamphlet/2027.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4420,"name":"囲碁部 （中高合同活動）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.buzan.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/pdf/jhs-exam/pamphlet/2027.pdf","verified